{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56422","headline":"游苑 · 苏癿","name":"游苑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭院开金鏁，周回赏碧堂。\n池深流水慢，岸阔引桥长。\n遇石攀藤息，逢林摘果尝。\n更呼园子问，何处可寻凉？\n（见伯三六一九卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏癿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}